Cell["\<\
Reverse-shell signs use ordinary transpose: p-to-s and d-to-p are negated, \
while d-to-s is not. For complex integrals, ensure the opposite directed bond \
is supplied consistently.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1356864609,ExpressionUUID->"33b659c7-9c28-6d45-9183-3c2d608b77ff"]
}, Closed]],

